#: ../../library/fractions.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!fractions` --- Rational numbers"
msgstr ":mod:`!fractions` --- 有理數"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/fractions.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/fractions.py`"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!fractions` module provides support for rational number arithmetic."
msgstr ":mod:`!fractions` 模組提供對有理數運算的支援。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:14
msgid ""
"A Fraction instance can be constructed from a pair of rational numbers, from "
"a single number, or from a string."
msgstr "Fraction 實例可以由一對有理數、單一數字或字串建構而成。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:23
msgid ""
"The first version requires that *numerator* and *denominator* are instances "
"of :class:`numbers.Rational` and returns a new :class:`Fraction` instance "
"with a value equal to ``numerator/denominator``. If *denominator* is zero, "
"it raises a :exc:`ZeroDivisionError`."
msgstr ""
"第一種版本要求 *numerator* 和 *denominator* 是 :class:`numbers.Rational` 的實"
"例，並回傳一個值等於 ``numerator/denominator`` 的新 :class:`Fraction` 實例。"
"如果 *denominator* 為零，則會引發 :exc:`ZeroDivisionError`。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:28
msgid ""
"The second version requires that *number* is an instance of :class:`numbers."
"Rational` or has the :meth:`!as_integer_ratio` method (this includes :class:"
"`float` and :class:`decimal.Decimal`). It returns a :class:`Fraction` "
"instance with exactly the same value. Assumed, that the :meth:`!"
"as_integer_ratio` method returns a pair of coprime integers and last one is "
"positive. Note that due to the usual issues with binary point (see :ref:`tut-"
"fp-issues`), the argument to ``Fraction(1.1)`` is not exactly equal to "
"11/10, and so ``Fraction(1.1)`` does *not* return ``Fraction(11, 10)`` as "
"one might expect. (But see the documentation for the :meth:"
"`limit_denominator` method below.)"
msgstr ""
"第二種版本要求 *number* 是 :class:`numbers.Rational` 的實例，或具有 :meth:`!"
"as_integer_ratio` 方法（這包括 :class:`float` 和 :class:`decimal.Decimal`）。"
"它會回傳一個值完全相同的 :class:`Fraction` 實例。此處假設 :meth:`!"
"as_integer_ratio` 方法會回傳一對互質的整數，且後者為正數。請注意，由於二進位"
"浮點數常見的問題（請參閱\\ :ref:`tut-fp-issues`），``Fraction(1.1)`` 的引數並"
"不完全等於 11/10，因此 ``Fraction(1.1)`` *不會*\\ 如預期般回傳 "
"``Fraction(11, 10)``。（但請參閱下方 :meth:`limit_denominator` 方法的說明文"
"件。）"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:40
msgid ""
"The last version of the constructor expects a string. The usual form for "
"this instance is::"
msgstr ""
"建構函式的最後一種版本預期接收一個字串。這種情況下，字串的常見形式為： ::"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:43
msgid "[sign] numerator ['/' denominator]"
msgstr "[sign] numerator ['/' denominator]"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:45
msgid ""
"where the optional ``sign`` may be either '+' or '-' and ``numerator`` and "
"``denominator`` (if present) are strings of decimal digits (underscores may "
"be used to delimit digits as with integral literals in code).  In addition, "
"any string that represents a finite value and is accepted by the :class:"
"`float` constructor is also accepted by the :class:`Fraction` constructor.  "
"In either form the input string may also have leading and/or trailing "
"whitespace. Here are some examples::"
msgstr ""
"其中可選的 ``sign`` 可以是 '+' 或 '-'，而 ``numerator`` 和 ``denominator``\\ "
"（如果有的話）是由十進位數字組成的字串（可以像程式碼中的整數字面值一樣使用底"
"線來分隔數字）。此外，任何表示有限值且能被 :class:`float` 建構函式接受的字"
"串，也都能被 :class:`Fraction` 建構函式接受。無論是哪種形式，輸入字串也都可以"
"有前導和／或尾隨的空白。以下是一些範例： ::"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:54
msgid ""
">>> from fractions import Fraction\n"
">>> Fraction(16, -10)\n"
"Fraction(-8, 5)\n"
">>> Fraction(123)\n"
"Fraction(123, 1)\n"
">>> Fraction()\n"
"Fraction(0, 1)\n"
">>> Fraction('3/7')\n"
"Fraction(3, 7)\n"
">>> Fraction(' -3/7 ')\n"
"Fraction(-3, 7)\n"
">>> Fraction('1.414213 \\t\\n')\n"
"Fraction(1414213, 1000000)\n"
">>> Fraction('-.125')\n"
"Fraction(-1, 8)\n"
">>> Fraction('7e-6')\n"
"Fraction(7, 1000000)\n"
">>> Fraction(2.25)\n"
"Fraction(9, 4)\n"
">>> Fraction(1.1)\n"
"Fraction(2476979795053773, 2251799813685248)\n"
">>> from decimal import Decimal\n"
">>> Fraction(Decimal('1.1'))\n"
"Fraction(11, 10)"
msgstr ""
">>> from fractions import Fraction\n"
">>> Fraction(16, -10)\n"
"Fraction(-8, 5)\n"
">>> Fraction(123)\n"
"Fraction(123, 1)\n"
">>> Fraction()\n"
"Fraction(0, 1)\n"
">>> Fraction('3/7')\n"
"Fraction(3, 7)\n"
">>> Fraction(' -3/7 ')\n"
"Fraction(-3, 7)\n"
">>> Fraction('1.414213 \\t\\n')\n"
"Fraction(1414213, 1000000)\n"
">>> Fraction('-.125')\n"
"Fraction(-1, 8)\n"
">>> Fraction('7e-6')\n"
"Fraction(7, 1000000)\n"
">>> Fraction(2.25)\n"
"Fraction(9, 4)\n"
">>> Fraction(1.1)\n"
"Fraction(2476979795053773, 2251799813685248)\n"
">>> from decimal import Decimal\n"
">>> Fraction(Decimal('1.1'))\n"
"Fraction(11, 10)"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:80
msgid ""
"The :class:`Fraction` class inherits from the abstract base class :class:"
"`numbers.Rational`, and implements all of the methods and operations from "
"that class.  :class:`Fraction` instances are :term:`hashable`, and should be "
"treated as immutable.  In addition, :class:`Fraction` has the following "
"properties and methods:"
msgstr ""
":class:`Fraction` 類別繼承自抽象基底類別 :class:`numbers.Rational`，並實作了"
"該類別的所有方法與運算。:class:`Fraction` 實例是\\ :term:`可雜湊的 "
"<hashable>`，且應被視為不可變的。此外，:class:`Fraction` 具有以下屬性與方法："

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:86
msgid ""
"The :class:`Fraction` constructor now accepts :class:`float` and :class:"
"`decimal.Decimal` instances."
msgstr ""
":class:`Fraction` 建構函式現在可接受 :class:`float` 和 :class:`decimal."
"Decimal` 實例。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:90
msgid ""
"The :func:`math.gcd` function is now used to normalize the *numerator* and "
"*denominator*. :func:`math.gcd` always returns an :class:`int` type. "
"Previously, the GCD type depended on *numerator* and *denominator*."
msgstr ""
"現在會使用 :func:`math.gcd` 函式來正規化 *numerator* 和 *denominator*。:func:"
"`math.gcd` 一律回傳 :class:`int` 型別。在此之前，GCD 的型別取決於 "
"*numerator* 和 *denominator*。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:95
msgid ""
"Underscores are now permitted when creating a :class:`Fraction` instance "
"from a string, following :PEP:`515` rules."
msgstr ""
"現在從字串建立 :class:`Fraction` 實例時允許使用底線，遵循 :PEP:`515` 的規則。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:99
msgid ""
":class:`Fraction` implements ``__int__`` now to satisfy ``typing."
"SupportsInt`` instance checks."
msgstr ""
":class:`Fraction` 現在實作了 ``__int__``，以滿足 ``typing.SupportsInt`` 的實"
"例檢查。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:103
msgid ""
"Space is allowed around the slash for string inputs: ``Fraction('2 / 3')``."
msgstr "字串輸入中的斜線前後允許有空格：``Fraction('2 / 3')``。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:106
msgid ""
":class:`Fraction` instances now support float-style formatting, with "
"presentation types ``\"e\"``, ``\"E\"``, ``\"f\"``, ``\"F\"``, ``\"g\"``, "
"``\"G\"`` and ``\"%\"``."
msgstr ""
":class:`Fraction` 實例現在支援浮點數風格的格式化，可使用表示型別 ``\"e\"``、"
"``\"E\"``、``\"f\"``、``\"F\"``、``\"g\"``、``\"G\"`` 和 ``\"%\"``。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:111
msgid ""
"Formatting of :class:`Fraction` instances without a presentation type now "
"supports fill, alignment, sign handling, minimum width and grouping."
msgstr ""
"未指定表示型別時，:class:`Fraction` 實例的格式化現在支援填充、對齊、符號處"
"理、最小寬度與分組。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:115
msgid ""
"The :class:`Fraction` constructor now accepts any objects with the :meth:`!"
"as_integer_ratio` method."
msgstr ""
":class:`Fraction` 建構函式現在可接受任何具有 :meth:`!as_integer_ratio` 方法的"
"物件。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:121
msgid "Numerator of the Fraction in lowest term."
msgstr "以最簡形式表示時 Fraction 的分子。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:125
msgid "Denominator of the Fraction in lowest terms. Guaranteed to be positive."
msgstr "以最簡形式表示時 Fraction 的分母。保證為正數。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:131
msgid ""
"Return a tuple of two integers, whose ratio is equal to the original "
"Fraction.  The ratio is in lowest terms and has a positive denominator."
msgstr ""
"回傳由兩個整數組成的 tuple，其比值等於原始的 Fraction。此比值為最簡形式且分母"
"為正。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:139
msgid "Return ``True`` if the Fraction is an integer."
msgstr "如果 Fraction 是整數則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:145
msgid ""
"Alternative constructor which only accepts instances of :class:`float` or :"
"class:`numbers.Integral`. Beware that ``Fraction.from_float(0.3)`` is not "
"the same value as ``Fraction(3, 10)``."
msgstr ""
"只接受 :class:`float` 或 :class:`numbers.Integral` 實例的替代建構函式。請注"
"意 ``Fraction.from_float(0.3)`` 與 ``Fraction(3, 10)`` 的值並不相同。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:151
msgid ""
"From Python 3.2 onwards, you can also construct a :class:`Fraction` instance "
"directly from a :class:`float`."
msgstr ""
"從 Python 3.2 開始，你也可以直接從 :class:`float` 建構 :class:`Fraction` 實"
"例。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:157
msgid ""
"Alternative constructor which only accepts instances of :class:`decimal."
"Decimal` or :class:`numbers.Integral`."
msgstr ""
"只接受 :class:`decimal.Decimal` 或 :class:`numbers.Integral` 實例的替代建構函"
"式。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:162
msgid ""
"From Python 3.2 onwards, you can also construct a :class:`Fraction` instance "
"directly from a :class:`decimal.Decimal` instance."
msgstr ""
"從 Python 3.2 開始，你也可以直接從 :class:`decimal.Decimal` 實例建構 :class:"
"`Fraction` 實例。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:169
msgid ""
"Alternative constructor which only accepts instances of :class:`numbers."
"Integral`, :class:`numbers.Rational`, :class:`float` or :class:`decimal."
"Decimal`, and objects with the :meth:`!as_integer_ratio` method, but not "
"strings."
msgstr ""
"替代建構函式，只接受 :class:`numbers.Integral`、:class:`numbers.Rational`、:"
"class:`float` 或 :class:`decimal.Decimal` 實例，以及具有 :meth:`!"
"as_integer_ratio` 方法的物件，但不接受字串。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:179
msgid ""
"Finds and returns the closest :class:`Fraction` to ``self`` that has "
"denominator at most max_denominator.  This method is useful for finding "
"rational approximations to a given floating-point number:"
msgstr ""
"找出並回傳最接近 ``self`` 且分母至多為 max_denominator 的 :class:`Fraction`。"
"此方法可用於找出給定浮點數的有理數近似值："

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:187
msgid "or for recovering a rational number that's represented as a float:"
msgstr "或是用於還原以浮點數表示的有理數："

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:200
msgid ""
"Returns the greatest :class:`int` ``<= self``.  This method can also be "
"accessed through the :func:`math.floor` function:"
msgstr ""
"回傳 ``<= self`` 的最大 :class:`int`。此方法也可以透過 :func:`math.floor` 函"
"式存取："

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:210
msgid ""
"Returns the least :class:`int` ``>= self``.  This method can also be "
"accessed through the :func:`math.ceil` function."
msgstr ""
"回傳 ``>= self`` 的最小 :class:`int`。此方法也可以透過 :func:`math.ceil` 函式"
"存取。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:217
msgid ""
"The first version returns the nearest :class:`int` to ``self``, rounding "
"half to even. The second version rounds ``self`` to the nearest multiple of "
"``Fraction(1, 10**ndigits)`` (logically, if ``ndigits`` is negative), again "
"rounding half toward even.  This method can also be accessed through the :"
"func:`round` function."
msgstr ""
"第一種版本回傳最接近 ``self`` 的 :class:`int`，並以偶數捨入法 (round half to "
"even) 處理剛好一半的情況。第二種版本將 ``self`` 捨入到最接近 ``Fraction(1, "
"10**ndigits)`` 的倍數（如果 ``ndigits`` 為負數，則是在邏輯上如此），同樣以偶"
"數捨入法處理剛好一半的情況。此方法也可以透過 :func:`round` 函式存取。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:225
msgid ""
"Provides support for formatting of :class:`Fraction` instances via the :meth:"
"`str.format` method, the :func:`format` built-in function, or :ref:"
"`Formatted string literals <f-strings>`."
msgstr ""
"提供透過 :meth:`str.format` 方法、:func:`format` 內建函式或\\ :ref:`格式化字"
"串字面值 <f-strings>`\\ 對 :class:`Fraction` 實例進行格式化的支援。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:229
msgid ""
"If the ``format_spec`` format specification string does not end with one of "
"the presentation types ``'e'``, ``'E'``, ``'f'``, ``'F'``, ``'g'``, ``'G'`` "
"or ``'%'`` then formatting follows the general rules for fill, alignment, "
"sign handling, minimum width, and grouping as described in the :ref:`format "
"specification mini-language <formatspec>`. The \"alternate form\" flag "
"``'#'`` is supported: if present, it forces the output string to always "
"include an explicit denominator, even when the value being formatted is an "
"exact integer. The zero-fill flag ``'0'`` is not supported."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``format_spec`` 格式規格字串並非以表示型別 ``'e'``、``'E'``、``'f'``、"
"``'F'``、``'g'``、``'G'`` 或 ``'%'`` 其中之一結尾，則格式化會遵循\\ :ref:`格"
"式規格迷你語言 <formatspec>`\\ 中所描述的填充、對齊、符號處理、最小寬度與分組"
"的一般規則。支援「替代形式」旗標 ``'#'``：如果有使用，它會強制輸出字串一律包"
"含明確的分母，即使被格式化的值恰為整數也是如此。不支援零填充旗標 ``'0'``。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:239
msgid ""
"If the ``format_spec`` format specification string ends with one of the "
"presentation types ``'e'``, ``'E'``, ``'f'``, ``'F'``, ``'g'``, ``'G'`` or "
"``'%'`` then formatting follows the rules outlined for the :class:`float` "
"type in the :ref:`formatspec` section."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``format_spec`` 格式規格字串以表示型別 ``'e'``、``'E'``、``'f'``、"
"``'F'``、``'g'``、``'G'`` 或 ``'%'`` 其中之一結尾，則格式化會遵循\\ :ref:"
"`formatspec`\\ 章節中為 :class:`float` 型別所描述的規則。"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:244
msgid "Here are some examples::"
msgstr "以下是一些範例： ::"

#: ../../library/fractions.rst:246
msgid ""
">>> from fractions import Fraction\n"
">>> format(Fraction(103993, 33102), '_')\n"
"'103_993/33_102'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(1, 7), '.^+10')\n"
"'...+1/7...'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(3, 1), '')\n"
"'3'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(3, 1), '#')\n"
"'3/1'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(1, 7), '.40g')\n"
"'0.1428571428571428571428571428571428571429'\n"
">>> format(Fraction('1234567.855'), '_.2f')\n"
"'1_234_567.86'\n"
">>> f\"{Fraction(355, 113):*>20.6e}\"\n"
"'********3.141593e+00'\n"
">>> old_price, new_price = 499, 672\n"
">>> \"{:.2%} price increase\".format(Fraction(new_price, old_price) - 1)\n"
"'34.67% price increase'"
msgstr ""
">>> from fractions import Fraction\n"
">>> format(Fraction(103993, 33102), '_')\n"
"'103_993/33_102'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(1, 7), '.^+10')\n"
"'...+1/7...'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(3, 1), '')\n"
"'3'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(3, 1), '#')\n"
"'3/1'\n"
">>> format(Fraction(1, 7), '.40g')\n"
"'0.1428571428571428571428571428571428571429'\n"
">>> format(Fraction('1234567.855'), '_.2f')\n"
"'1_234_567.86'\n"
">>> f\"{Fraction(355, 113):*>20.6e}\"\n"
"'********3.141593e+00'\n"
">>> old_price, new_price = 499, 672\n"
">>> \"{:.2%} price increase\".format(Fraction(new_price, old_price) - 1)\n"
"'34.67% price increase'"

